Source: vchord-bm25
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), cargo, libicu-dev,
 clang | clang-21 | clang-20 | clang-19 | clang-18 | clang-17 | clang-16,
 libclang-dev | libclang-21-dev | libclang-20-dev | libclang-19-dev | libclang-18-dev | libclang-17-dev | libclang-16-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://vchord.pgsty.com/

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-vchord-bm25
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-vchord-bm25
Depends: postgresql-PGVERSION, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: BM25 ranking and indexing for PostgreSQL
 VectorChord-BM25 implements BM25 ranking and Block-WeakAnd (WAND) indexing
 over PostgreSQL tsvector values. It works with standard PostgreSQL text search
 configurations and can optionally integrate with pg_tokenizer.
